      "text": "The Competent Authority has approved the appointment of Shri Ajay Kumar Jaiswal,\nIRSME(2008) as CVO, Northern Coalfields Ltd. (NCL), Singrauli under the Ministry of Coal\nwith pay at level 13 (Rs. 1,23,100 – 2,15,900/-) of the pay matrix, for an initial period of 3 years\nfrom the date of assumption of charge of the post or until further orders, whichever is earlier."
